    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "yeah that makes sense. it just feels like such a nightmare trying to track down every little piece of info scattered across different servers. it's like once you think you've cleared everything out, there's always some weird little remnant or hidden fragment hiding in a corner that you missed. how do we deal with those specific edge cases where data seems to just linger or hide unexpectedly?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
